    start 2026-09-16T16:03:19Z
    marker OK
    end 2026-09-16T16:09:59Z
  marker lines 1, start lines 1, end lines 1 (expect 1, 1 and 1)
  the capture above was COPIED from an earlier probe run, not produced by
  this run: it ran 2026-09-16T16:03:19Z to 2026-09-16T16:09:59Z, when HEAD was 39b22495cc82f4d84db35c1feb1fb5a05bee69fc.
  N6 the capture's provenance is recorded, not implied: as-expected
  N6 a detached process survived 400 s and wrote its marker: as-expected

